      <div class="faq-item reveal"><button class="faq-q">Is Shopify (or Wix, or WooCommerce) the problem? <span class="pm"></span></button><div class="faq-a"><p>No. Brands rank very well on every one of those platforms. They have real technical limits, but known and workable ones. The problem is what was done — or not done — inside them.</p></div></div>
      <div class="faq-item reveal"><button class="faq-q">My site is new: is it just a matter of time? <span class="pm"></span></button><div class="faq-a"><p>Partly. Google grants its trust gradually. But "waiting" fixes neither the indexing, nor the naming, nor the orphan pages. A young, well-structured site outranks an old, neglected one — age is a factor, not an excuse.</p></div></div>
    </div>
